**D-60 high-risk loop:** `high-risk-sonnet-loop.mdc` Phase 1 (Sonnet pre-review) + Phase 3 (`high-risk-adversarial:`) + Phase 4 (`sonnet-verify:`) run **before commit**; this gate is **Phase 5 pre-push** — the sole **pre-push security diff verdict** — distinct Task, distinct evidence (`security-gate-id` vs `sonnet-instruct:` / `high-risk-adversarial:` / `sonnet-verify:`).
